cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: >-
  If you use op_infer or its flepimop2 provider, please cite this software
  and record the exact release version used in your methods.
type: software
title: "op_infer: the statistical layer of the op stack"
abstract: >-
  Parameter spaces, priors, observation models, posteriors with provenance,
  calibration gates, identifiability and design studies for mechanistic
  models, wrapping mature inference libraries, with a separately distributed
  flepimop2 provider.
authors:
  - family-names: Macdonald
    given-names: Joshua
    email: jmacdo16@jh.edu
version: "0.0.1"
license:
